{
  "id": "universal-jc-grab",
  "name": "Jump-cancel grab",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "A standing grab out of a dash",
  "why": "Out of a dash, Z gives a dash grab. A jump-cancelled grab gives the standing grab instead, with the dash's speed: for most characters it is quicker than the dash grab, and the dash before it can stop or turn at any moment.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 120,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "A jump-cancelled grab is a grab pressed during jump squat. It turns the jump into a standing grab.",
    "expect": "Each jump is judged when the jump squat ends: whether {char} grabbed during it, and how many frames after the jump. After misses, the coach shows your jump and Z against the {J}-frame jump squat.",
    "example": [
      {
        "stick": [
          1,
          0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 6
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 6,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "Z",
        "frame": 7
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: control stick forward: dash",
      "6": "Frame 6: jump pressed. Jump squat begins",
      "7": "Frame 7: Z pressed in jump squat: standing grab, still sliding"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "A grab during jump squat",
        "text": [
          "On every frame of jump squat after the first, the game checks for a grab and for an up smash before it lets {char} leave the ground. Press Z, or A with L or R held, during jump squat and {char} grabs from the ground instead of jumping: the jump squat is cancelled.",
          "Jump squat is {J} frames, counting the jump's press as frame 1. Z on frames 2 to {J} grabs. Z on frame {J+1} is too late: {char} is in the air."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "Z",
                "frame": 2
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed. Jump squat begins",
              "2": "Frame 2: Z pressed in jump squat: standing grab"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  1
                ],
                "words": "Jump squat",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  2,
                  "J"
                ],
                "words": "Z now: grab",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+1",
                  "J+1"
                ],
                "words": "Z here: airborne",
                "kind": "late"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "characters": "jump_squat"
      },
      {
        "title": "Out of a dash",
        "text": [
          "During a dash, Z gives a dash grab. A jump cancels the dash into jump squat, and Z during the jump squat gives the standing grab, while {char} keeps sliding with the dash's speed.",
          "So the order is: dash, jump, then Z 1 to {J-1} frames after the jump. Z on the same frame as the jump is still read in the dash and gives a dash grab."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 6
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 6,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "Z",
                "frame": 7
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: control stick forward: dash",
              "6": "Frame 6: jump pressed. Jump squat begins",
              "7": "Frame 7: Z pressed in jump squat: standing grab, still sliding"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  5
                ],
                "words": "Dash",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  6,
                  6
                ],
                "words": "Jump",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  7,
                  "J+5"
                ],
                "words": "Z now: grab",
                "kind": "go"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
